WEBVTT

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.200
Try Lilt.

00:00:14.275 --> 00:00:17.000
You can select text anywhere on your screen.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.275
Lilt keeps the original layout and reads it aloud, highlighting each word as it goes

00:00:23.575 --> 00:00:26.662
The controls appear when you move your pointer over the reading,

00:00:26.662 --> 00:00:28.725
and disappear when you move away.
